{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:completion:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSDictionary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tags","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"completion:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^"},{"text":")(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Supported value types: NSString, NSNumber, NSArray (for list tags), NSNull (to delete)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Block called when the operation completes.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Receives nil on success, or an NSError describing the failure."}]}],"name":"completion"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Similar to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setTags:"},{"type":"text","text":" but provides feedback when the operation completes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Use this when you need to:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirm tags were successfully set before proceeding"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement retry logic on failure"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update UI based on tag update status"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chain multiple operations that depend on tag updates"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Update subscription status with confirmation and retry:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class SubscriptionManager {","","    private let maxRetries = 3","","    func updateSubscriptionStatus(_ subscription: Subscription,","                                  completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","        updateWithRetry(subscription: subscription, attempt: 1, completion: completion)","    }","","    private func updateWithRetry(subscription: Subscription, attempt: Int,","                                 completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","","        let tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"subscription_tier\": subscription.tier.rawValue,","            \"subscription_status\": subscription.isActive ? \"active\" : \"expired\",","            \"subscription_expiry\": ISO8601DateFormatter().string(from: subscription.expiryDate),","            \"is_premium\": subscription.tier != .free,","            \"features_enabled\": subscription.enabledFeatures.map { $0.rawValue }","        ]","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags) { [weak self] error in","            if let error = error {","                if attempt < (self?.maxRetries ?? 3) {","                    let delay = Double(attempt) * 2.0","                    DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + delay) {","                        self?.updateWithRetry(subscription: subscription,","                                             attempt: attempt + 1,","                                             completion: completion)","                    }","                } else {","                    completion(.failure(error))","                }","                return","            }","","            Analytics.track(\"subscription_tags_updated\", properties: [","                \"tier\": subscription.tier.rawValue","            ])","            completion(.success(()))","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags with a completion handler for confirmation.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:completion:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"setTags:completion:","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:completion:"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:completion:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:completion:":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags with a completion handler for confirmation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:completion:","title":"setTags:completion:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setTags:completion:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:completion:","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore"}}}